##[
Capacitor Component Library - Maximum Complexity Stress Test (v0.1.5)
========================================================================

This file implements capacitors across all types and packages with EXTREME
complexity to expose compiler weaknesses beyond what resistors tested:

1. Multiple dielectric types (C0G/NP0, X7R, X5R, Y5V, Z5U) - Tests enum-like strings
2. Polarized vs non-polarized (electrolytic, tantalum, ceramic) - Tests polarity
3. Voltage derating curves - Tests complex numerical relationships
4. ESR (Equivalent Series Resistance) - Tests frequency-dependent properties
5. ESL (Equivalent Series Inductance) - Tests parasitic modeling
6. Ripple current ratings - Tests AC vs DC specifications
7. Leakage current - Tests extremely small currents (nA, pA)
8. Temperature coefficients with complex notation (±15%, +22/-82%)
9. Lifetime ratings (hours at temperature) - Tests time units
10. Multiple package sizes (01005 to 2824 for ceramics, radial/axial for through-hole)
11. Asymmetric pad shapes for polarized components
12. Complex metadata with manufacturer-specific codes
13. Extreme capacitance ranges (0.1pF to 10000µF)
14. High voltage ratings (up to 3000V for ceramics)
15. Negative temperature coefficients
16. Frequency-dependent impedance curves
17. Self-resonant frequency (SRF) specifications
18. Insulation resistance (GΩ, TΩ)
19. Dissipation factor (DF) and Quality factor (Q)
20. Aging rates for Class II ceramics

If this compiles cleanly, the component parser can handle real-world complexity.
]##

## ============================================================================
## CERAMIC CAPACITORS - C0G/NP0 (Class I) - Ultra-stable, low capacitance
## ============================================================================

component Capacitor_0201_1pF_C0G:
    metadata:
        manufacturer: "Murata"
        part_number: "GRM0335C1E1R0BA01D"
        package: "0201"
        capacitance: "1pF"
        tolerance: "±0.1pF"
        voltage_rating: "25V"
        dielectric: "C0G/NP0"
        description: "Ultra-stable Class I ceramic capacitor"
        datasheet: "https://www.murata.com/en-us/products/capacitor/ceramiccapacitor"
        category: "Passive"
        subcategory: "Ceramic Capacitor"
        dielectric_class: "Class I"
        temperature_coefficient: "0±30ppm/°C"
    
    pins:
        Pin1
        Pin2
    
    layout:
        shape: Rectangle(0.6mm, 0.3mm, 0.3mm)
        pin_positions:
            Pin1 at [0mm, 0.15mm]
            Pin2 at [0.6mm, 0.15mm]
        pad_shapes:
            Pin1: Rectangle(0.3mm, 0.3mm)
            Pin2: Rectangle(0.3mm, 0.3mm)
    
    electrical:
        capacitance: 1pF
        tolerance: 0.1pF
        voltage_rating: 25V
        dielectric_type: "C0G"
        temperature_coefficient: 30ppm
        dissipation_factor: 0.1%
        insulation_resistance: 10000MΩ
        esr_100khz: 0.5Ω
        esr_1mhz: 0.3Ω
        esr_10mhz: 0.2Ω
        self_resonant_freq: 15GHz
        operating_temp_min: -55°C
        operating_temp_max: 125°C
    
    render:
        type: procedural
        shape: smd_passive
        body_color: "#d4a574"
        endcap_color: "#c0c0c0"

